b/ref 17592186441134 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441146 1079 #uuid "cb7f776c-eb99-528b-aabd-b4033c71b940" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441147 1068 #edb/ref 17592186441144 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441147 1069 "q-77402" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441147 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441147 1071 "Let $⟨2,y⟩$ be the solution of the system of equations below. \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}4x+ky=5 \\\\ x+2y=-4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following equations could be solved to find the value of $k?$\n\nI. $|\\begin{aligned}4 & k \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|=|\\begin{aligned}5 & k \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}|$\n\nII. $2|\\begin{aligned}4 & k \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|=|\\begin{aligned}5 & k \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}|$\n\nIII. $|\\begin{aligned}4 & k \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|=2|\\begin{aligned}5 & k \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}|$" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441147 1072 #uuid "1485a2c5-d3d5-5ae7-bfda-a8f34f74aef0" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441147 1074 "The determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =|\\begin{aligned}4 & k \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAccording to Cramer's rule, the value of $x$ is given by $x=\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D},$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{x} & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & k \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D} \\\\ 2 & =\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}5 & k \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}4 & k \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}|} \\\\ 2|\\begin{aligned}4 & k \\\\ 1 & 2\\end{aligned}| & =|\\begin{aligned}5 & k \\\\ -4 & 2\\end{aligned}|\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"II only\"." 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441148 1068 #edb/ref 17592186441145 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441148 1069 "q-77396" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441148 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441148 1071 "Consider the system of equations \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAccording to Cramer's rule, $x=$" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441148 1072 #uuid "659100c2-e69a-5015-bd46-ea6499418f4e" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441148 1074 "We are given the system\n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}x-y=2 \\\\ 2x+3y=1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThe determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we construct ${D}_{x}$, we replace the first column of the coefficient matrix by the right-hand side column of the given system:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{x} & =|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, according to Cramer's rule, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D}=\\frac{|\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}|}{|\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ 2 & 3\\end{aligned}|}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441149 1068 #edb/ref 17592186441146 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441149 1069 "q-42985" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441149 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045486 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441149 1071 "Let $⟨-12,y⟩$ be the solution of the system of equations below. \n\n$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}7x+9y=42 \\\\ kx+10y=-4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWhich of the following equations could be solved to find the value of $k?$\n\nI. $|\\begin{aligned}7 & 9 \\\\ k & 10\\end{aligned}|=-12$\n\nII. $|\\begin{aligned}7 & 9 \\\\ k & 10\\end{aligned}|=-38$\n\nIII. $|\\begin{aligned}7 & 9 \\\\ k & 10\\end{aligned}|=456$" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441149 1072 #uuid "9a324339-2131-569e-b62b-73969b420199" 13194139534854 17592186045417 true] [17592186441149 1074 "The determinant of the coefficient matrix is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}D & =|\\begin{aligned}7 & 9 \\\\ k & 10\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nAccording to Cramer's rule, the value of $x$ is given by $x=\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D},$ where\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{D}_{x} & =|\\begin{aligned}42 & 9 \\\\ -4 & 10\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =420+36 \\\\  & =456.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x & =\\frac{{D}_{x}}{D} \\\\ -12 & =\\frac{456}{|\\begin{aligned}7 & 9 \\\\ k & 10\\end{aligned}|} \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}7 & 9 \\\\ k & 10\\end{aligned}| & =\\frac{456}{-12} \\\\ |\\begin{aligned}7 & 9 \\\\ k & 10\\end{aligned}| & =-38\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the correct answer is \"II only\"." 13194139534854 17592186045417 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-13abba68-c603-520c-b95e-bae74246f467" 17592186441124 "answer-1c2929bd-edc2-5508-beb1-1d9807142bf1" 17592186441125 "answer-1f13ed83-8c4f-597b-9f02-b31307021e5b" 17592186441126 "answer-37e0bd1c-a3ae-5f52-a82d-3a71181d02f2" 17592186441127 "answer-3cc8305b-aa26-5938-bd09-82bace4ba090" 17592186441128 "answer-45f349a4-8a10-5b19-b4f8-85a49af13560" 17592186441129 "answer-6feb8d82-ec98-5ab3-916e-e0964f921e81" 17592186441130 "answer-742473cb-daf1-51d3-8173-d6d820c2cd4a" 17592186441131 "answer-8d3a2a97-810a-5f83-ae72-fc21a76e36d4" 17592186441132 "answer-8fa3964d-0f84-58b2-a2df-245a34859a58" 17592186441133 "answer-bd29ef89-365b-598b-abba-79648038c1f5" 17592186441134 "answer-c159eb9f-4f2c-5439-9834-15476295ce88" 17592186441135 "answer-d2f9ea97-6403-5269-8dae-1465c6fa454a" 17592186441136 "answer-d56c8d4b-ec4f-5319-9ebf-a207cab9ae06" 17592186441137 "answer-e54fae11-f4e6-587e-bf65-bc9a931e3cc7" 17592186441138 "answer-ed90928a-c1d1-55de-ac12-d5f61d39fd02" 17592186441139 "answer-f0696591-4c24-54b6-8b14-e466d380abaa" 17592186441140 "answer-f4490cc5-d61d-513b-835c-43fda69e74cc" 17592186441141 "answer-f7c1f9ea-b9de-5947-a51a-a2f5c3cb34c7" 17592186441142 "answer-fefcd620-c9c3-502f-a8a1-81af7c238754" 17592186441143 "answer-field-1aec48af-7f8c-53fd-bb3d-101ace543e43" 17592186441144 "answer-field-4d79a455-f937-543f-8ebe-441cfa18719